    "slug": "wri-dentistry-referral-to-the-general-practitioner-oral-thrush-and-possible-undiagnosed-diabetes",
    "title": "Dentistry — Referral to the general practitioner: oral thrush and possible undiagnosed diabetes",
    "prompt": "Using the case notes, write a letter as instructed. Write 180–200 words. Select only the information that is relevant to the reader and to the purpose of the letter.",
