    "slug": "wri-pharmacy-letter-to-the-general-practitioner-discrepancies-found-after-a-hospital-discharge",
    "title": "Pharmacy — Letter to the general practitioner: discrepancies found after a hospital discharge",
    "prompt": "Using the case notes, write a letter as instructed. Write 180–200 words. Select only the information that is relevant to the reader and to the purpose of the letter.",
    "difficulty": "CORE",
    "topicTag": "medicines-reconciliation",
