    "slug": "wri-veterinary-science-emergency-referral-to-neurology-acute-paraparesis",
    "title": "Veterinary Science — Emergency referral to neurology: acute paraparesis",
    "prompt": "Using the case notes, write a letter as instructed. Write 180–200 words. Select only the information that is relevant to the reader and to the purpose of the letter.",
